Vendored from tag v0.46.0 and modified by Irio.
MarkdownHighlightedCode, MarkdownHighlightedCodeFence, and MarkdownHighlightedCodeBlock
accept softWrap. When softWrap is true, code lines wrap to the block width instead of
scrolling horizontally. The default remains horizontal scrolling.

